<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>
<p>AdSense approval is achievable when you run a real, helpful, trustworthy website. Focus on solid content, a clean layout, clear navigation, and the basic legal pages, and you will be ahead of most new bloggers. Add a sitemap, a cookie notice, and policy compliance, and you make it easy for AdSense to say yes.</p>'
