        'content' => '<p>Most people think of Pinterest as social media. It is actually a visual search engine — which makes it perfect for bloggers who want steady, free traffic that keeps coming long after you post, unlike a tweet that vanishes in hours.</p>
<h2>Set Up a Business Account</h2>
