<p><strong>Why no traffic yet?</strong> It usually takes 60–90 days of consistency before momentum builds.</p>
<h2>Give It Time</h2>
<p>Unlike a tweet, a pin can drive traffic for months. Give the strategy sixty to ninety days before judging it. Patience plus consistency is the entire game on this platform, and the bloggers who quit at week six miss the compounding that starts around week ten.</p>'
